---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site title="Privacy Policy" description="Dav/Devs privacy policy.">
  <article class="privacy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        This site is built with privacy as a default, not an afterthought. Here's what we
        collect and why, in line with Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA).
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Nothing on our servers.</strong> This is a static site with no database and
          no server-side session — there is nothing to collect, because there is nowhere to
          store it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Theme and like preferences</strong> — stored only in your browser's local
          storage (dark/light mode, which posts you've liked). This never leaves your device
          and is never sent to us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Standard hosting logs</strong> — your hosting provider may keep basic access
          logs (request path, response status, timestamp) for operational purposes, subject to
          their own retention policy.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No third-party analytics or tracking scripts (no Google Analytics, no Facebook Pixel).</li>
        <li>No advertising cookies.</li>
        <li>No selling or sharing of any data with third parties.</li>
        <li>No account system, so there is no personal profile to breach.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Essential cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We don't set any cookies. The theme toggle and like button described above use your
        browser's local storage instead, which is not sent with requests and is not a cookie
        in the tracking sense.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be directed via the contact links in the footer.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Site>

<style>
  .privacy {
    max-width: var(--prose-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px var(--page-padding-x);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .body strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
